    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d362">

                <pb facs="0570" n="554" sameAs="frus:frus1951v07p1/pg554"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">795.00/6–2551: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            United States Mission at the United Nations
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret   priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-06-25T19:00:00-04:00">June 25, 1951—7 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1019. Eyes only Gross. Dept this afternoon informed Brit Emb that you have been
                    requested to make discreet approach to Malik for purpose of eliciting
                    clarification re latter’s statement June 23.</p>
                <p>Dept accedes to Brit desire that you and Jebb see Malik together.</p>
                <p>You may wish to inform Jebb re the questions which you expect to raise with
                    Malik.</p>
                <p>
                    FYI we informed Brit Emb that Emb Moscow has
                    been asked to see Vyshinsky or Gromyko on same subject matter and ask same
                    questions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
